{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act7mini_level_act7mini_st04",
  "groupId": "act7mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "遗落灯塔",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act7mini/level_act7mini_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4d38b1c740234789719d1df1d0ac8601b496b6a3cde521395c3031b8137a323e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:18 P.M. 天气/晴\n伊比利亚以北，临海荒镇\n我们已经抵达计划坐标。\n目标建筑外观与先行调查报告中的描述一致。\n下面小队会进入建筑，做初步查探。稍后可能通讯中断，如有特殊情况，注意信号弹。\n蓝毒，通讯完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这里有个入口。唔，看起来并不是最初的建造者留下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "边缘痕迹很粗糙，像是用利斧硬劈开的。或许是赏金猎人干的？听说他们中的一部分很喜欢来这一带“寻宝”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "大概因为他们大多不是伊比利亚人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "是啊。毕竟，对那些好不容易逃出去的人来说，这种遗迹称得上“毒性”不浅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "那些留下的人......教会，审判庭。他们也没办法过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "他们要应付的已经太多了。而且他们也不愿意看到这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......就像我小时候也不想看自己的腿一样。再怎么用力蹬着，它们也没法跑起来——现在的伊比利亚，并不想关注这些“坏掉的部件”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "小格劳用自己作比喻，我都快要忍不住同情那地方了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔，这回我听出来你是在开玩笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "电磁脉冲力场释放完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那么，往上走，还是往下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我听你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我想往上走。不知道为什么，我觉得就该往上。这里就像......一座塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "塔？你觉得它有多高？露在地面上的部分最多只有三层。这能派上什么用场？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这么说的话，我们还是应该往下走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你提醒了我。我们还不知道下面有多深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "那就往下吧。我会跟着你，守住你的背。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哎呀，小格劳这么说，我放心多了。不过，还是好希望今天能不用打架啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "唔，好黑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "照明系统完全坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "连你都修不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这是几十年前伊比利亚的技术。和雷神工业的管线设计在思路上就有很大区别。如果给我几天时间的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那算啦。能不能修好，还是让可露希尔小姐和后面的工程队来考虑吧。我们两个没必要在这地下墓穴憋这么久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "墓穴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "一个比喻，又或者不是。这建筑里面弥漫着死气沉沉的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "荒废了几十年，又给海水泡了，在土里埋着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嘘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你说，如果我们不说话，会不会听见幽灵的惨叫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "幽、幽灵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哎呀，骗你的啦。抓我衣服的力道请稍稍轻一些哦，我对这批新衣料还是挺满意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......啊。还是把便携源石灯打开吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这样就亮多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你对这些技术遗迹真着迷啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这是过去的海边城市才有的科技。现在的伊比利亚，没多少人见过这些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "它们......是用来做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "瞭望？信号中转？能源产业？或者说......只是观光旅游用的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "说不定是关押人的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......也有可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "有些人看往日的伊比利亚，看到的只有遗落的技术，蒙尘的黄金。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "然而，就在那最辉煌的时代，黄金之城下面，可埋着不少枯骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "小格劳为什么要道歉？把我的祖先抓到伊比利亚的阿戈尔人，早就给海浪腐蚀得骨头都不剩下了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我并不讨厌伊比利亚，也不讨厌阿戈尔人。而且，现在我也没那么讨厌我自己了。除了博士，还有小格劳的功劳啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这些技术......会不会让你想起不好的回忆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我只关心这地方能不能为罗德岛所用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "说到底，这才是我们来这里的目的，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......是的。观察环境，解析数据，确定能回收的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔，可惜被拆得七零八落的。单纯是老化和环境作用的话，零件不会被破坏得这么彻底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "看这一块，都滚那么远了......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "怎么回事？突然就掏出了倾诉者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "有......幽灵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "幽灵？......你是说前面通道里的那道影子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "一动不动，不像活物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "看服饰......似乎是赏金猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这位置离入口不远。说不定他就是开了那道缝的人，进来以后死在了这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "啊，原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "等下。先不要走近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "还不确定他是怎么死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "你担心有危险？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "一个赏金猎人，死在距离出入口这么近的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "杀死他的那样东西，可能很不简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "再退后一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我闻到了......海水的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "海水？海岸线离这里不算近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蓝毒让格劳克斯留在原地，自己继续前进，在距离尸体一米外蹲下，仔细观察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "好吧。只是一些海草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "骨架完整。没有被怪物啃食的痕迹，也没有别的致命外伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（轻嗅）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "没有常见毒素致死迹象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "从姿势来看，他就是被海草缠到了，溺水窒息而亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我没看见水啊，到处都很干燥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你仔细看墙上海水留下的锈蚀痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔......有两种程度不同的锈迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这里，被淹了两次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "第一次，海水摧毁了这栋建筑，无论它之前的功能是什么，它都已经失效。第二次，海水又突然涌到了这个位置，将内部再次浸泡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "而这个倒霉鬼，当时恰好闯了进来，自以为捡了大便宜，正喜滋滋地拆墙上的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "海水漫过来的时候，他来不及撤退，又给海草缠住了手脚，一番挣扎后失去了性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这也不能怪他。他是个库兰塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......好可怜。他们对海的力量一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "博士说过，对海的研究，在大部分陆地国家，都被锁在少数海洋学家的高阁之上，不怎么受欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哎呀，也不奇怪。谁都只对看得见、能征服的东西更感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "或许......只有曾经的伊比利亚除外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "那也是过去的事了。我都没见过大海。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔......我甚至不明白为何你对海的味道这么警觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你听过，那个传闻么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "关于那些灾难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我们并不......谈论这些。这在伊比利亚不被容许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你们习惯了闭口不谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "习惯很难更改。在罗德岛上，我们也不怎么说起......家乡。而且我们每个人，对那些事件、甚至那个地区本身的印象都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "偶尔，我和温蒂会聊起来。哪怕我们都是在伊比利亚长大的阿戈尔人，我发现她眼里的伊比利亚，都和我眼里的完全不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这很正常，不是吗？当讨论被禁止，那人们对同一件事的记忆也只剩下自己眼里那一块碎片了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "他们......有意割断了人们将碎片相连的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔，现在只有我们两个人。我本可以说，但我......我不敢。我的嗓子被堵住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我担心我一开口，这通道上映着的影子就会朝我扑过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......虽说我很清楚这只是源石灯的投影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "投影......还真是绝妙的比喻呢。他们巧妙地转移了人们的视线，让人们恐惧影子，而非背后庞大的真相。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我好冷......但是我在出汗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "以前我都想象不到自己能站在这里，和你聊起这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "谁不是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我想，是这个黑漆漆的封闭的建筑保护了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这里有一具尸体，我们也不知道通道的尽头有什么。这却比广阔的、开放的场所......更令人放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这些墙给了我们一种能够掌控局面的错觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "你说的对。至少没第三双眼睛盯着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那可未必。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "别再逗我啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "好啦好啦，我不开玩笑。说回灾难。实际上，这并不是审判庭起的头。不再谈论这些，是上岸的阿戈尔人的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "最初，大概只是一种自我保护机制吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "自我......保护？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你知道阿戈尔人为什么会来到岸上吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我......不知道。我以为我们本该在这里。虽然很多伊比利亚人不这么想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我也没那么清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "嗯......但你比我们知道得都多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "说来有些可笑。当这些历史在阿戈尔人的脑子里渐渐消失之后，反而是我们还记得更牢一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我的祖先在百余年前被阿戈尔人抓走。他们当时想要的，正是我们与生俱来的“毒物”能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这是......为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "他们不断地提取，反复地实验。他们想知道我们这些来自陆地深处的毒素能否作为某种武器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "他们要对付什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我不知道。我怎么可能见过？在我们祖辈的描述中，那是一种无比巨大的、陆上不存在的可怕生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "来自海里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我只能说，很大可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我想过是否要开口提问。问博士，问凯尔希医生，或者......直接问她们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "有一次，我在走廊上撞见了干员斯卡蒂。在那一瞬间，这些藏在我心底的问题浮了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "她应该不会说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯，我想她确实不会。但最后，是我没问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......我不确定自己有没有窥探真相的勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "就像上岸的阿戈尔人，他们用几百年时间忘记了那种恐惧。因为这样，他们才能心安理得地在陆上扎根，慢慢地把自己活成伊比利亚的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "谁会舍得放下好不容易得来的新生活，继续投身在可能永无休止的抗争之中？甚至那灾难还不知会何时到来，真来了，所做的一切挣扎也未必有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "就算是我，在博士教会我那么多以后，我也希望自己能拥有一个崭新的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "那我们......是不是应该回头就走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "还来得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "或许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......你还在往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哎呀，没错。我竟然还在往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "现在想想，这么多年，我也没有一天放弃自己用毒的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "搞不好哦，我从来没有摆脱过那些奴役我祖先的阿戈尔人的幽灵。我的内心深处依然相信，有一天我的毒素会遇见它等待的那些敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我们下来几层了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......我忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我也忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这座塔比我想象的要深......呃，高。幽闭的空间迷惑了我们的神经。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "啊，我好像有幻觉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你看到了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（眨眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我看到前面有光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "而且，正在慢慢往上飘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（压低声音）把灯灭了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一片黑暗之中，有一点炽白的光在不远处摇曳。\n现在蓝毒确定了那不是她们的灯留下的重影。是幻觉，还是真实的？哪种情况更危险？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（慢慢靠近。不要打草惊虫。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（是敌人么？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（做好交战准备。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（倾诉者随时待命。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（好。我们快撞上了。前面是个拐角。注意我的手。我敲三下，等到第三下，就——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一支弩箭悄然破空。\n它射中了那团模糊的白色。不，并没有射中。即将碰撞的时候，发生了一些角度偏移。\n没关系。无人能看见，它在射出去的一瞬间就裂成了两支，一前一后，将白光牢锁。\n然而下一刻，白光暴涨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "倾诉者，满功率！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "等、等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "微波增幅——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我没有恶意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "咳，咳咳......好痛，撞到后背了......好厉害的冲击波......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "别再来一次啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "真要讨饶的话，你应该先停止施法，不知名的术师小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "呃，是说我的光吗？不、不是的，你们误会了，现在的光只是用来照明而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "刚刚那一瞬间，我也是下意识防御。请相信我，我绝对没有想攻击你们的意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "难怪......我感觉暖暖的，亮亮的，没什么不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "小格劳，别急着放松警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这位女士的源石技艺并不弱。而且，还有一些特别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "唔......这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "别、别举起来呀！还有，商量一下，能不能把这个箭从我脖子上移开一点点......一点点就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我......我快不敢吸气了......呜呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我可以撤下弩箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你也必须扔掉你的法杖。如果你想作弊......相信我，你的动作不会有我的箭快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少女乖乖丢掉了法杖。光一下熄灭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "打开源石灯吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "原来这个光源是你们的啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我们是你的目标？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不，我不是这个意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我本来待在下面。这里没有别人。我看到有光，就想知道是不是有人来了，准备打个招呼，所以开始往上走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你说你在这里待了一阵了，请问你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "啊，忘了自我介绍......那个，我叫艾莉亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "艾莉亚小姐，你是伊比利亚人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是啊。很明显吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "随口问问。你要说不是的话，我就猜哥伦比亚，维多利亚，总有法子让你开口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我怎么打了个寒颤......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你是伊比利亚人，一个术师，还有这种灯光一样的源石技艺。你和审判庭有关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "审判庭？不不，没有，我都没见过那些大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那你是来这里做什么的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（会不会太像审讯了？我们也只是过来看看而已啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（直接问最高效。而且，她似乎没察觉到不适。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "唔......我来这里做什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "其实我也不清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "嗯？艾莉亚小姐，你有记忆受损的困扰吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那倒没有啦。怎么来这里的，待了几天，这些我全都记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "两天前，我向一名当地人打听，附近有没有什么赚钱的机会。我需要工作......不然会饿肚子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "他拿走了我身上最后几枚硬币，然后告诉我，我可以到这里来寻找财富。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（听起来这位小姐是遇上了骗子......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "他可能把你当成了赏金猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这一带过去有不少赏金猎人造访。你带着法杖，看起来又......呃，出身不错。他们或许把你当成想要尝尝冒险滋味的哪家大小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "啊......是这样吗？他们竟然误会了我的意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（也可能没误会啊......真的就是看你好骗。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（微笑）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "很、很好笑吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "没有。我这位朋友虽然见生人时有些放不开，可她似乎很关心你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "咦？谢谢......谢谢关心！没关系，我只是迷路了而已，看见这里也有一座灯塔，就忍不住想休息一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "迷、迷路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "不是这个，你说这栋建筑是灯塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "对呀。灯塔在伊比利亚很常见，你们没见过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "唔......可能只有海边常见。我在外面待了半年，去过的离海远一些的城镇的确都没有灯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "你是在海边长大的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯。离这儿不算太远，只是一座小镇，你们大概没听说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "那里......现在怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "挺好的......吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "镇上人不算多，大家相处很融洽。老师说，我们还算幸运，大海带来的灾难暂时放过了我们的家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "呼......真好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "除了......灯塔。自那一天开始，我们的灯塔再也没亮起来过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那一天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "对，就是那一天。几十年前，最大的灾难......到来的那一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "短短一瞬间，整个伊比利亚的海岸线都一齐暗了下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "从此......再无光明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "艾莉亚小姐，你对灯塔很熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "因为我从小在灯塔里面长大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "......这种灯塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "别误会，我们镇上的灯塔状况比这里好得多，没有经受太多损害，只是信号灯再也亮不起来而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "调向机械组件，系统管控中枢，供能管线，自动化计算核心，外墙全息投影装置，无线电通讯设备，统统没有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "老师带着我，每天都会按照章程维护检查所有环节，就连外墙都定期清理修补过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我可以拍着胸脯保证，除了无法避免的材料老化，我们的灯塔，状态和几十年前一样好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "好厉害啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "说到灯塔，艾莉亚小姐的眼睛都在发光......就跟我调整倾诉者时候一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你和你的老师，你们是灯塔管理员吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "咦，我忘了说吗？抱歉，我的老师正是一名光荣的灯塔看守人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我的话，我还不是......一座灯塔只需要一名正式看守人，呃，我只是见习的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "而且现在我......呃，我到外面来了。见习都说不上了吧，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "出来这么久，还把这些步骤记得这么清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "因为我每天晚上睡觉之前都会再背一遍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "艾莉亚小姐是真的热爱这份工作啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我想看见老师描绘的景象。那是老师的老师向她描绘的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "夜晚的海边，由一座座灯塔切割出纵横交错的航线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "远处各种宏伟的钻井和海上堡垒灯火荧荧；近处大小船只出入无阻，比任何一座陆地城市都要繁华，比任意一个白昼还要明亮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "如果靠得够近，你甚至可以看到伊比利亚的阿戈尔人在大陆架附近打造的水下城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "这一切，都由屹立在伊比利亚海岸线上的数千座灯塔守望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "现在，灾难摧毁了我们的能源体系。没有一座灯塔能够像往日一样亮起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "可老师和我依然守在灯塔上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "每一夜，老师都会尝试点灯。信号灯失效，我们就打造新的光源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我们的光或许并不能像真正的灯塔一样，照亮一整片海域。我们只能照亮一个小小的角落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "而海上也早就没有了归航的船只——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "但我们依然在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "即使，无论你们如何守望，这片海岸都将永远地沉寂下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯。即便如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "这就是塔顶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "前两天我已经检查过。这座灯塔被破坏得好厉害......早就不剩下什么了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "只有这个还在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "这是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "伊比利亚灯塔的能源核心。最先进的技术，也是最先遭到摧毁的部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "没法用了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "最初的技术......遗失了。老师和我都无法复原它的设计。失去了完整的能源体系支持，没有任何一种替代方案能让这核心发挥出原本的效率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "可能......唔，如果你没意见的话，我想带回罗德岛，和可露希尔小姐一起研究一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "啊......我不是说我有把握......毕竟当年伊比利亚的科技路线太特殊了......就像这块核心，我只能看出来它并不是以源石能源技术为根基设计的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......并非以源石为能源？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "也不是。它的能量很大概率还是来自源石。但是......技术基础不同。我甚至觉得，源石类能源并不是驱动这装置的最佳选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "怎、怎么啦？是不是我说的这些太无聊了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "你们真的可以让灯塔重新亮起来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我只是觉得可以试试。可能要用很多时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我......我想加入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "你们的罗德岛，需要我这样的人吗？我会的事情不多......我、我会努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "首先，你需要准备一份简历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "简历是什么？我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "唔......奇怪，我的头好晕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "说着说着就晕倒了。她这是怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（耸肩）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "啊......她还是中毒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我差点以为她这样的斐迪亚也和你一样，能免疫我的神经毒素呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "现在看来，只是发作得比较晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（该怎么说呢？或许不是体质特别，只是......多少有些迟钝？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（先别分析啦，解、解毒剂......不会没准备吧？毕竟是和我一起的双人任务......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "别急，只是短时麻痹而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "先出塔吧。等吹上一阵冷风，她就会恢复意识了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "脉冲力场解除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "可总算联系上了。女士们，你们没有遇上啥危险吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "除了一些小小的插曲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "哎呀，醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我好像打了个盹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "醒得比预期时间也要早一些呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "不必戒备。探查任务完成得很顺利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以，为什么会有第三个人的声音？听起来还是位不认识的年轻小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "是在任务地点遇到的，艾莉亚小姐为我们提供了关键情报。之后她会随我们一起回到罗德岛，向人事部门投递简历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，那先说声欢迎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾莉亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "你、你好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "对了，说下结论。这里是——一座灯塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？灯塔？我没听错吧？这和线人说的“看起来很复杂”不大相符啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（我还以为是什么重要设施......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "是伊比利亚在那场灾难之前建造的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......懂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "内部结构还算完整，但相关技术被破坏得很厉害，尚不确定可以回收多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "麻烦通知后续工程队——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "这里有成为罗德岛新办事处的潜力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，要是真成了新办事处，以后我是不是会经常跑回来啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "离那地方这么近......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过，也没办法吧？不光我们需要。线人说，最近又从南边被毁的城镇跑出来一些难民。路途艰辛，总得有人帮他们一把。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "是啊，这座灯塔......搞不好会变得很有用哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "为附近的感染者提供医疗服务，帮助有需要的人，观察......正在一天天逼近大地的海潮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "speakerId": "avg_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "即便无法和过去那样轻易地带来光明......它或许还是可以继续守望这片海岸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
